14641211,2025-07-14,Mortgage,Conventional home mortgage,Struggling to pay mortgage,"Trying to communicate with the company to fix an issue related to modification, forbearance, short sale, deed-in-lieu, bankruptcy, or foreclosure","I am filing this complaint because of the enormous financial strain me and my family have been put under by First Technology Credit Union. This has been going on for four years but the last year has been the worst. 

