14831995,2025-07-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"I am submitting this complaint because all three major credit reporting agenciesXXXX Equifax, and XXXX inaccurately reporting a charge-off account for XXXX with account number ending in XXXX, dated XX/XX/year> and showing a {$0.00} balance. Despite being marked with a zero-dollar balanceclearly indicating that the debt has been paid, resolved, or otherwise satisfiedthe account is still being reported as a charge-off. This is both misleading and harmful, as it creates the false impression that I defaulted on a financial obligation when, in reality, the account shows no amount owed. 

