15008584,2025-07-31,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"I am writing to formally dispute a late payment reported on my credit file for XXXX - XXXX, which is inaccurate due to unauthorized access and tampering involving my account. 
