SUPPORTING CASE LAW 1. XXXX XXXX Trans Union XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXX ( XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX ) : This case held credit bureaus accountable for failing to conduct adequate investigations in consumer disputes, emphasizing the duty to rigorously verify any disputed information. 
